10052060;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">True Paget disease</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Typically non-mucinous</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Apocrine-like</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 194.65pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CK7+</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">GCDFP15+</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CK20&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CDX2&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 177.2pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><strong>Secondary Paget disease (usually from rectal adenocarcinoma or [rarely] adenoma but occasionally from anal gland carcinoma)</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\">Either mucinous or non-mucinous</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\">Usually intestinal</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 194.65pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\">CK7+/&minus;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\">CK20+</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\">CDX2+</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 177.2pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"236\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Skin adnexal&nbsp;/ mammary (non-Paget type)</span></strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.0pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Typically non-mucinous</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 163.05pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"217\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Skin adnexal</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 194.65pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CK7+</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CK20&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk210052060;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CDX2&minus;</span></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">CRC, colorectal carcinoma; IHC, immunohistochemistry; ISH, in&nbsp;situ hybridization.</p>",
